{"id":"f9068f8953ee2e56","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-gelfand-naimark.md","title":"Gelfand–Naimark Theorem","display":"thm-gelfand-naimark — Gelfand–Naimark Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-gelfand-naimark","aliases":["58-thm-gelfand-naimark"],"display":"thm-gelfand-naimark — Gelfand–Naimark Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-cstar-algebra]]","[[58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-gelfand-naimark"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-gelfand-naimark</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gelfand-naimark — Gelfand–Naimark Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"051b1a34c565ddef\" href=\"?note=051b1a34c565ddef\" title=\"58-df-cstar-algebra\">58-df-cstar-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3639c3f839b6c954\" href=\"?note=3639c3f839b6c954\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space\">58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A\\in V\">\\(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\">\\(\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"051b1a34c565ddef\" href=\"?note=051b1a34c565ddef\" title=\"58-df-cstar-algebra\">58-df-cstar-algebra</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is commutative and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_A\">\\(1_A\\)</span> is its multiplicative unit</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(A)\">\\(\\Delta(A)\\)</span> is the set of nonzero unital complex <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*\">\\(*\\)</span>-homomorphisms <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:A\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(\\chi:A\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{w^*}\">\\(\\tau_{w^*}\\)</span> is the weak-star topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(A)\">\\(\\Delta(A)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*};\\mathbb C)\">\\(C(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*};\\mathbb C)\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebra of continuous complex-valued functions with pointwise operations, conjugation, and the supremum norm</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_A(a)(\\chi)=\\chi(a)\">\\(\\Gamma_A(a)(\\chi)=\\chi(a)\\)</span> is the Gelfand transform</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the compact-Hausdorff predicate</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> is the set-coded bijection predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}naimark}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\cdot_A(1_A,a)=a=\\cdot_A(a,1_A))\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\cdot_A(a,b)=\\cdot_A(b,a))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*})\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}\\bigl(\\Gamma_A,A,C(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*};\\mathbb C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Gamma_A(+_A(a,b))=\\Gamma_A(a)+\\Gamma_A(b)\n\\land\\Gamma_A(\\lambda a)=\\lambda\\Gamma_A(a)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{150pt}\\land\\Gamma_A(\\cdot_A(a,b))=\\Gamma_A(a)\\Gamma_A(b)\n\\land\\Gamma_A(a^*)=\\overline{\\Gamma_A(a)}\n\\land\\|\\Gamma_A(a)\\|_\\infty=\\|a\\|\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}naimark}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\cdot_A(1_A,a)=a=\\cdot_A(a,1_A))\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\cdot_A(a,b)=\\cdot_A(b,a))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*})\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}\\bigl(\\Gamma_A,A,C(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*};\\mathbb C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Gamma_A(+_A(a,b))=\\Gamma_A(a)+\\Gamma_A(b)\n\\land\\Gamma_A(\\lambda a)=\\lambda\\Gamma_A(a)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{150pt}\\land\\Gamma_A(\\cdot_A(a,b))=\\Gamma_A(a)\\Gamma_A(b)\n\\land\\Gamma_A(a^*)=\\overline{\\Gamma_A(a)}\n\\land\\|\\Gamma_A(a)\\|_\\infty=\\|a\\|\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The space is the character spectrum with its weak-star topology, and the isomorphism is the explicitly named Gelfand transform; this removes existential predicates with no upstream signature.</li>\n<li>Every unital commutative complex <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebra is isomorphic to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(X)\">\\(C(X)\\)</span> for a compact Hausdorff spectrum <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, unique up to homeomorphism.</li>\n<li>In the nonunital case the spectrum is locally compact and the representation is by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0(X)\">\\(C_0(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This establishes the duality between commutative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebras and compact Hausdorff spaces.</li>\n<li>Non-commutative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebras generalize this to non-commutative geometry.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cstar-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"051b1a34c565ddef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cstar-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cstar-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"051b1a34c565ddef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)$ as in [[58-df-cstar-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}$ is the set-coded bijection predicate from [[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"1_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta(A)","display":false},{"tex":"*","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:A\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{w^*}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta(A)","display":false},{"tex":"C(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*};\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_A(a)(\\chi)=\\chi(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gelfand\\text{-}naimark}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\cdot_A(1_A,a)=a=\\cdot_A(a,1_A))\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\cdot_A(a,b)=\\cdot_A(b,a))\\\\\n&\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*})\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}\\bigl(\\Gamma_A,A,C(\\Delta(A),\\tau_{w^*};\\mathbb C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Gamma_A(+_A(a,b))=\\Gamma_A(a)+\\Gamma_A(b)\n\\land\\Gamma_A(\\lambda a)=\\lambda\\Gamma_A(a)\\\\\n&\\hspace{150pt}\\land\\Gamma_A(\\cdot_A(a,b))=\\Gamma_A(a)\\Gamma_A(b)\n\\land\\Gamma_A(a^*)=\\overline{\\Gamma_A(a)}\n\\land\\|\\Gamma_A(a)\\|_\\infty=\\|a\\|\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"C(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"C_0(X)","display":false},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"C^*","display":false}],"bytes":2616,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-gelfand-naimark.md|58-thm-gelfand-naimark]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["051b1a34c565ddef","3639c3f839b6c954","36d7463d215be751","d583890235faf0d5"]}